WEBVTT
Kind: descriptions
Language: en

NOTE Described-video track for Śūnyasabhā (The Assembly of Emptiness). Each cue covers one musical phrase or scene beat and is short enough to be spoken at a natural pace within its time.

ad-001
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Rainy night. A red neon sign over a steel door. People queue.

ad-002
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
The title fades in beneath it: Śūnyasabhā, The Assembly of Emptiness.

ad-003
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.200
The door swings open. Blue light and smoke spill out.

ad-004
00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:17.200
A crowd streams into a neon-lit cathedral.

ad-005
00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:20.400
Stomping feet. One dancer has a metal leg.

ad-006
00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:24.900
Giant stone heads drip blue fire. The DJ raises an arm.

ad-007
00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:28.300
Close-ups: the DJ's tattooed arm, headphones, closed eyes.

ad-008
00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:34.100
Hands on the decks. A chrome-armed dancer dances inside a cheering ring.

ad-009
00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:37.100
A humanoid robot dances; people film it.

ad-010
00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:42.500
A young man by a pillar; a screen over his eye scrolls text.

ad-011
00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:45.800
The DJ sings in profile, head tipped back.

ad-012
00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:51.900
The DJ dances on stage, arms flung overhead, hopping side to side. Fists rise below.

ad-013
00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:55.600
The circuit wall glows orange-red. The ring turns violet.

ad-014
00:00:55.600 --> 00:01:00.100
The DJ spreads both arms wide and bows over the crowd.

ad-015
00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:03.800
Raised arms, seen from behind and above. Stepping feet.

ad-016
00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.800
A woman dances with a glowing drink.

ad-017
00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:10.000
A bald, braided woman with a titanium spine.

ad-018
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:14.400
Memory wipe 15, complete. A robot hand scratches her fifteenth tally.

ad-019
00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:19.600
She dances alone in a circle of light, the crowd around her.

ad-020
00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:23.200
She pulls a ceiling cable out of her spine.

ad-021
00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:28.100
She kisses a dark-haired lover; their cupped hands hold a small flame.

ad-022
00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:31.100
Quick portraits: an older man, fists raised.

ad-023
00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:34.900
More faces. A braided, bald woman raises both fists.

ad-024
00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:41.500
The DJ sits cross-legged in the blue ring between the stone heads, singing, one palm raised.

ad-025
00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:48.800
Hands move slowly, to the chest, then into the lap. Fists rise from the crowd below.

ad-026
00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:56.200
Three dancers, a tall man in white, a woman in pink, a stocky dancer in black, trade moves.

ad-027
00:01:56.200 --> 00:02:01.500
Back on the throne, the DJ sways cross-legged, eyes half-closed.

ad-028
00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:04.600
An eye's red iris reflects the dancers.

ad-029
00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:08.100
A smoker outside sees police lights, runs in.

ad-030
00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:12.600
The DJ throws an arm up. Everyone turns to the door.

ad-031
00:02:12.600 --> 00:02:16.800
Speakers pump. Police boots come down the stairs.

ad-032
00:02:16.800 --> 00:02:20.600
An officer shouts through a megaphone. Everyone lies down.

ad-033
00:02:20.600 --> 00:02:23.800
The DJ looks up, alarmed, and shouts.

ad-034
00:02:23.800 --> 00:02:26.800
Only the titanium woman stays standing.

ad-035
00:02:26.800 --> 00:02:30.000
She raises her head to face the officer.

ad-036
00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:34.300
The crowd stays down. The DJ sings, eyes open.

ad-037
00:02:34.300 --> 00:02:37.800
The officers fire three shots into the air.

ad-038
00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:41.400
An officer forces her to her knees.

ad-039
00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:44.900
Behind the DJ, the whole hall lies flat.

ad-040
00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:49.400
She kneels under guard. No one else moves.

ad-041
00:02:49.400 --> 00:02:52.700
A visor targets the DJ, glitches and cracks.

ad-042
00:02:52.700 --> 00:02:56.200
The officers reel. The crowd rises and runs.

ad-043
00:02:56.200 --> 00:03:01.400
The decks sit abandoned. Everyone streams up the stairs, past fallen officers.

ad-044
00:03:01.400 --> 00:03:07.300
The hall is empty: dark ring, smoking braziers, litter on the wet floor.

ad-045
00:03:07.300 --> 00:03:12.800
Credits. Śūnyasabhā, The Assembly of Emptiness, with a Suno link.

